  (truthy) makes genuine Claude Code emit NO attribution header at all. Proves the
  header is optional first-party telemetry, not a hard auth requirement — though in
  the May-5 proxy test its *presence* is what flipped Max-plan routing to "not extra
  usage". So: optional to CC, but meaningful to Anthropic's billing classifier.
